}}

 {{Gamedesc
| image = {{#var:Fiend's Grip icon0}}
| desc = CHANNELED - Grips an enemy unit, disabling it and causing heavy damage over time, while stealing mana every 0.5 seconds based on the unit's maximum mana.
}}
* The ability effects are applied as follows per interval:
** {{Symbol|Affect|Self}}
*** The self-{{M|mana restore}}.
** {{Symbol|Affect|Enemy}}
**# The {{M|pure}} {{M|spell damage}}.
**# The offensive {{M|mana}} loss.

* {{cf|aghnotes}} {{Symbol|Illusions}} {{Symbol|Modifier|Buff}} {{Code|bane_fiends_grip_cast_illusion}} {{to}} {{Symbol|Stun}}
** The [[illusions]] utilize the modifier that [[stuns]] the affected enemy unit, and has the following properties:
*** The debuff activates when Bane's {{Code|bane_fiends_grip}} debuff disappears, and continues applying the ability effects sourced to the created illusions.
*** This {{M|Aghanim's Scepter|text=ability upgrade}} specifically only works if the illusion itself has {{A|Bane|Fiend's Grip}}.
*** Hence, it does not work with {{Symbol|bonus agh}} {{M|Spell Reflection}} source procs.

